## CLI usage (verified)

- Entry point: `hdctl` (or `python -m engine.cli`, defined in `engine/cli/main.py`).
- Subcommands: `showcompat`, `aux-preview`, `bg:resolve`, and dev-only `dev:sampler` (APP_ENV in `dev|test|local`).
- Exit codes: 0 on success; 64 for usage/validation/IO errors surfaced via `CliError`; showcompat vendor/engine failures return exit 1 as enforced by the CLI error-path tests; other non-zero codes are command-specific. PF05 (CLI/API/Vendor Ref) remains the canonical exit-code taxonomy; current vendor/engine numeric mapping is documented here until implementation aligns (known canon mismatch until PF05 alignment). Errors emit stderr-only code strings (no JSON envelopes in the CLI path).
- `showcompat` accepts `--pair-file`, `--a-file/--b-file` (aliases `--a/--b`), stdin, or birth arguments for compat payloads. Add `--conjunction` to emit the conjunction contract; conjunction input can be supplied by `--user-a/--user-b`, `--a-file/--b-file`, `--pair-file`, or stdin pair payloads. Success prints LF-terminated canonical JSON to stdout. In conjunction mode, `--dump-reader` and `--dump-admin-dir` are rejected (`CONJUNCTION_DUMPS_UNSUPPORTED`).
- Deterministic artifact generator: `python tools/cli/generate_showcompat_artifacts.py` captures `artifacts/cli/showcompat/stdout.json`, `artifacts/cli/showcompat/stdout.json.sha256`, and `artifacts/cli/showcompat/args.json` under closed rails.
- `aux-preview` previews Aux narrative ids/text for compat tuples using the sealed narrative pack.
- `bg:resolve` is a Phase S8a BodyGraph resolution surface with `--source {db,vendor,auto}` under closed rails. Closed rails still refuse vendor resolution before route-policy classification or outbound I/O. Under explicitly open rails, `--source vendor --dry-run` with a configured v2 base selects the version-neutral `charts` route and deterministic v2 ChartResult adapter; generic ingest/non-dry-run writes remain fail-closed for configured v2 bases until mapped-cache persistence is implemented. Non-v2 bases preserve explicit legacy BodyGraph fallback.

