- Conjunction writer evidence artifacts: `artifacts/writer/conjunction_write_readback.log` and `artifacts/writer/conjunction_writer_summary.json` (generated by `tools/evidence/generate_conjunction_writer_evidence.py`, requiring explicit caller-provided open rails: `SAFE_MODE=0` and `ALLOW_NETWORK=1` when provider acquisition is needed).
- `/internal/version` D3 artifacts: `artifacts/ops/internal_version/{body_get.json,body_get.sha256,headers_get.txt,headers_head.txt,headers_cond_if_none_match.txt,headers_cond_if_modified_since.txt,two_run_identity.log}` (all with `.path_proof.txt`; two-run log is the governed coupling proof).
